The JSON files in this directory are a Derivative Database of OpenStreetMap.

Café locations, names, coordinates and website URLs:

  [© OpenStreetMap contributors](https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright)
  
  [Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0](https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/)

Menu URLs, menu item names and prices were collected from publicly accessible
café websites. They are not part of the OpenStreetMap data, are not covered by
ODbL, and are provided for academic research only, without warranty.

This license applies to the data only. The source code is licensed under
GPL-3.0, see ../LICENSE.
